ry/_/page/gamedayfinal112126/week-12-top-games-highlights-takeaways","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Predicting the College Football Playoff: Who's most likely to make the field?","description":"Find out which teams our experts think will make this season's CFP.","published":"2026-11-22T06:30:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/playoffpredictions112126/cfp-predictions-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN Staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College Football Playoff top 12 projection after Week 12","description":"We assess how the selection committee could stack the top teams in the country after Week 12.","published":"2026-11-22T14:49:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50552244/projecting-2026-playoff-top-12-week-12-cfp","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-22T05:08:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska's jab at Ohio State's 'THE' leads top Week 12 CFB trolls","description":"Nebraska deployed a simple but effective troll that poked fun at its opponent's propensity to emphasize the \"the\" in \"The Ohio State University.\"","published":"2026-11-22T04:22:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50554531/nebraska-ohio-state-trolls-college-football-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia clinches SEC title game berth with win at South Carolina","description":"Nate Frazier ran for 94 yards and two touchdowns, and No. 1 Georgia clinched a spot in the final SEC championship game with a victory over South Carolina on Saturday night.","published":"2026-11-22T07:48:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558713/georgia-clinches-sec-title-game-berth-win-south-carolina","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-22T04:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5154734/griffin-wilde","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Griffin_Wilde"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Griffin Wilde","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Griffin_Wilde","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:24Z","intro":"Griffin Wilde is an American college football wide receiver for the Northwestern Wildcats. He previously played for the South Dakota State Jackrabbits.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Wilde attended Thomas Jefferson High School in Sioux Falls, South Dakota. Over his junior and senior seasons he combined for 100 receptions for 1,858 yards with 22 touchdowns. Wilde committed to South Dakota State University to play college football. He also played basketball in high school."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Wilde was a starter his true freshman year at South Dakota State in 2023 and had 20 receptions for 399 yards and six touchdowns. He became the Jackrabbits number one receiver in 2024, recording 71 receptions for 1,147 yards and 12 touchdowns. After the season, Wilde entered the transfer portal and transferred to Northwestern University. He was a starter his first year at Northwestern in 2025. In their upset victory over the Penn State Nittany Lions, he had seven receptions for 94 yards and a touchdown. Wilde was named MVP of the 2025 GameAbove Sports Bowl. In 2026, Wilde faced his former team and recorded three receptions for 104 yards in an 34-18 win."}]}}